{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261116/photo/bkn-20261116153444291-1116_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261116163343\"/><p>受傷婦人送院治療。</p><p>今日(16日)上午11時01分，姓麥(50歲)男子駕駛中型貨車，駛離粉嶺樂業路8號一停車場泊位時，意外撞倒一名姓吳(74歲)婦人，她倒地腰部受傷，由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院治療。警員到場經調查後，以涉嫌「危險駕駛」拘捕麥男，他現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T09:15:31.435389+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T07:34:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T10:09:39.124882+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:08:57.228650+00:00","content_hash":"7426be43961306ff358503cc4584ee654114b4463d8d77d2d4f130c813dc9fa2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T09:15:31.435389+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}